cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use polyxios in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: polyxios
abstract: >-
  polyxios is a fast, dependency-light Python library to read and write 3D
  mesh, scene and point-cloud file formats, with a single in-memory
  representation shared by every codec.
